  "WWF No Mercy's shaders, recorded by tools/record_shaders.mjs from web/shader_plan.json (web/record_shaders.sh) in",
  "Chrome: section 0 the launcher, the intro and the title (Start pressed through) and the main menu; then one section",
  "for a match, a load in each of the eight arenas (whose matches draw the same shaders but one): Start Game with the",
  "save deleted, Start through the intro to the title (game_state.js says the menus' code is loaded), A for the main",
  "menu, Exhibition, Single Match, 1P against the CPU, the arena, the rules as they are, the first superstar for both,",
  "then Start past the versus screen and the entrance and A to the bell, and 30 s of the match. Not played: the other",
  "match types and modes (tag, ladder, cage, Survival, Royal Rumble, Smackdown Mall, the championship modes), the",
  "attract demos, entrances watched through, and two humans."
